{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/common_2020_ghost_020.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/common_2020_ghost_020.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_01",
      "hash64": "C4780CFDD2B29596",
      "text": "你明明在不久之前\\n才刚来参加道馆测验……[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_02",
      "hash64": "C4780BFDD2B293E3",
      "text": "现在却成了冠军，\\n还替首席办事。[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_03",
      "hash64": "C4780AFDD2B29230",
      "text": "一到这个岁数，\\n就会感到时间真是一晃而过啊。[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_04",
      "hash64": "C47811FDD2B29E15",
      "text": "……多愁善感的感觉不适合我！\\n最棒的莱姆IN DA HOUSE！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_05",
      "hash64": "C47810FDD2B29C62",
      "text": "用动真格的对战\\nCHECK OUT MY SOUL！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_06",
      "hash64": "C4780FFDD2B29AAF",
      "text": "嫩叶力量很柔弱！\\n成熟之后才雄厚！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_07",
      "hash64": "C4780EFDD2B298FC",
      "text": "发挥本领SHAKE MY SOUL！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_08",
      "hash64": "C47815FDD2B2A4E1",
      "text": "HAHAHA！真让人吃惊！\\n你的拳头简直棒极了！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_09",
      "hash64": "C47814FDD2B2A32E",
      "text": "我的灵魂疯狂地颤抖，\\n都变成冰沙了！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_10",
      "hash64": "C47487FDD2AF7DC0",
      "text": "我刚才叫你菜鸟，\\n真是抱歉啊。[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_11",
      "hash64": "C47488FDD2AF7F73",
      "text": "我想让也慈认可幽灵的力量，\\n所以才忍不住着急了起来。[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_12",
      "hash64": "C47489FDD2AF8126",
      "text": "你的激情是货真价实的。\\n我可以保证。[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_13",
      "hash64": "C4748AFDD2AF82D9",
      "text": "从今往后，我莱姆\\n会当你的后盾的。[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_14",
      "hash64": "C4748BFDD2AF848C",
      "text": "如果遇到让你恼火的训练家\\n或幽灵的话就马上叫我啊。\\r\\n我会助你一臂之力的。[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "common_2020_ghost_020_ghost_15",
      "hash64": "C4748CFDD2AF863F",
      "text": "在这个GOOD的世界讴歌人生吧！\\n拜拜，宝贝！[VAR 0x0114(001B)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001B"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
